type: image
style: chalk drawing on green board
aspect: 1:1
resolution: 1024x1024

prompt: |
  A robot drawn entirely in chalk on a dark green chalkboard.
  The robot is in a professor pose: wearing a chalk-drawn mortarboard cap,
  holding a pointer stick, standing next to a small chalk-drawn easel.
  On the easel: a simple diagram with boxes and arrows labeled "LEARN".
  The robot's expression is warm and encouraging — round eyes, slight smile.
  Drawn in white chalk with yellow chalk accents (the cap tassel, the pointer tip).
  Blue chalk used for the diagram on the easel.
  The style should look like it was ACTUALLY drawn in chalk:
  - Slightly uneven lines, varying pressure
  - Faint dust around stroke edges
  - Some areas brighter (fresh chalk) vs. lighter (older strokes)
  Green chalkboard background (#2d4a2d). No digital perfection.
  The feeling: a beloved teacher drew this during an especially good lecture.

usage: Mascot for the Chalkboard theme — onboarding, section dividers, progress milestones.
